acceptance_criteria: Corrected rejected rows can be replayed without reapplying successful rows; diagnostic exports exclude disallowed columns and include checksums.
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T19:35:31.380Z",codex-agent,"Implementation uses native SDK explicit-ID creates, schema validation, locking and append-only history rather than a parallel item store. Portable JSON manifests hash permitted source cells and observed destination values with source row/column and a mapping revision. Retry CSVs retain stable keys and exclude successful rows and disallowed columns. Structural and output failures use typed remedies; row failures carry bounded codes. Tests exercise real non-git trackers with PATH excluding git, concurrent creates, retry history preservation and exact-byte artifact checksums. Current CLI registry version was verified as 2026.10.22; tracker writes use the unchanged repo pin 2026.10.15."
  "2026-10-22T19:42:04.586Z",codex-agent,"Public-data validation: immutable non-git copy of public main d5dbdb0a52e3e25ee79d95b98cf0b7585cd5602d, 120 certified items; selected 24 rows, imported 20 and rejected 4, corrected all 4, replayed all 4 with zero new creates. All 20 original successful histories and the complete read-only source snapshot stayed byte-identical. Verified 40 initial cell records, 1 excluded column, 2 exact-byte checksums, a 129-byte receipt and 10166 ms measured validation. Behavioral revert proof: changing only importLineage to include successful rows in rejects failed the count assertion; changing only its permitted-column projection to raw rows failed the disallowed-cell sentinel assertion. Both mutations restored. Targeted coverage reached 100 percent lines, branches and functions for lineage.ts. See docs/row-lineage-validation.md for reproduction."
  "2026-10-22T19:53:19.762Z",codex-agent,"Ready PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/pull/182. Implementation commit d1df1a784b6adb80866f204f6efd3448f5420999 passed CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/actions/runs/39842704813: npm and Bun release gates on Node 22 and 26, unchanged thresholds. Node 26 logs report 319/319 tests per gate, zero failures and 100 percent gated lines/branches/functions; all three packed scenarios passed per gate, including the minimum host and real CLI lineage/replay counts. The complete matrix is green. Linked pm test ran 4/4 successfully; build/typecheck, test typecheck, lint, docstrings, duplicate and changelog checks passed locally. Local health reported inherited global-extension host skew and shared clone configuration drift; fresh CI tracker health passed in both jobs. No merge, release or reviewer approval claimed. This final evidence and claim release will be committed, with CI checked again on that final head."
  "2026-10-23T15:30:07.747Z",codex-agent,"DELIVERED: merged PR #182 (e6f21c6d84c90adb64acb8384f378a758326eb20) is an ancestor of audited main cca10876ae5a4fcb505ffe533e00211941659ecc. Inspected on main: test/lineage.test.ts, docs/row-lineage-validation.md. Corrected rejected rows replay without successful-row/history changes; permitted-column projection excludes disallowed values and exact-byte checksums accompany diagnostic exports. Public-copy and native no-git/full-CI evidence is retained. This tracker audit inspected existing tests/files; it does not claim a new full product test run."
